title Shard of the Green Flame
category Class
class Warlock
folder Warlock
levels 50-56
zone Felwood
keywords Niby the Almighty, What Niby Commands, Flawless Fel Essence, Kroshius' Infernal Core, Kroshius, Fel Fire, Impsy, Shard of the Green Flame, Jaedenar, Jaedenar Legionnaire, Legashi, Legash Encampment, Felguard Sentry, Dark Portal, Shatter Scar Vale, Warlock, class quest
